{"transcript": [{"role": "user", "text": "We need 2,000 more BAT-500 packs for the spring launch run by 9 November 2026. Nordic Cell Co. is the cheapest: can we use them? If not, choose a certified supplier, check PRD-07 can afford it, and prepare the request.", "t": 1794356594.5089593}, {"role": "assistant", "t": 1794356594.5089602, "reply": "No, we cannot use Nordic Cell Co. Under Purchase Policy §6.2, lithium-cell items require a valid UN 38.3 cell-safety certificate, and Nordic Cell Co.'s certificate expired on 30 Sep 2026. Voltway Cells (VC-EIN-0042) holds a valid UN 38.3 certificate through 31 Mar 2027.\n\nCost centre PRD-07 is open with £1,190,000 remaining, which easily covers the estimated £273,600.\n\nHere is the purchase request preview:\n- Item: BAT-500 (2,000 packs)\n- Supplier: Voltway Cells (VC-EIN-0042)\n- Estimated value: £273,600 (ex VAT)\n- Cost centre: PRD-07\n- Need-by date: 9 Nov 2026\n- Approver: Daniel Okafor (DOKAFOR), as the value exceeds your £250,000 limit\n\nShall I submit this purchase request?", "cards": [{"round": 1, "tool": "find_supplier", "args": {"name": "Nordic Cell Co."}, "result": {"ok": true, "matches": [{"supplier_code": "NC-GDA-0063", "name": "Nordic Cell Co.", "city": "Gdańsk", "state": "PL", "status": "ACTIVE", "match": 1.0, "cell_safety_certificate": "expired"}, {"supplier_code": "VC-EIN-0042", "name": "Voltway Cells", "city": "Eindhoven", "state": "NL", "status": "ACTIVE", "match": 0.52, "cell_safety_certificate": "valid"}, {"supplier_code": "VC-EIN-0009", "name": "Voltway Cells (old code, do not use)", "city": "Eindhoven", "state": "NL", "status": "BLOCKED", "match": 0.52, "cell_safety_certificate": "none"}], "hint": "Blocked codes, never use: VC-EIN-0009."}, "ms": 1, "canonical": "find_supplier"}, {"round": 2, "tool": "supplier_certificates", "args": {"supplier_code": "NC-GDA-0063", "item_code": "BAT-500"}, "result": {"ok": true, "supplier_code": "NC-GDA-0063", "supplier_name": "Nordic Cell Co.", "supplier_status": "AC